category: Libs
requires: cygwin libaudec0
sdesc: "Wrapper library over minimp3, sndfile and libsamplerate (utilities)"
ldesc: "libaudec (lib audio decoder) is a wrapper library over minimp3, sndfile and
libsamplerate for reading and resampling audio files, based on Robin Gareus'
audio_decoder code (https://github.com/x42/silan/tree/master/audio_decoder)"

